Third-party material
--------------------

This repository contains no third-party source code, artwork or fonts.

It records hashes and metadata about upstream material that it does not
redistribute:

  * VCV Rack and the Rack SDK, copyright VCV, GPL-3.0-or-later
    (pins in upstream/versions.json).
  * VCV Rack Manual pages and their code samples, copyright VCV; license
    unclear (upstream/examples.json, docs/licensing.md). No manual text is
    included.

Binary artifacts will also carry the notices for code compiled from Rack
headers and for any bundled Python runtime and binding library. Each artifact
lists them in a generated third-party license manifest. docs/licensing.md
describes the planned contents.
